00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:28.360
This is not a safe area, and for now, the otter seeks less hazardous regions.

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:35.850
While the animals of the Everglades are more active at night than in the daytime,

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:40.150
