00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:48.550
All animals living at Otter Hammock remain alert for danger.

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:55.750
A raccoon detects the approach of a big cougar who is on the prowl for a meal.

00:15:59.150 --> 00:15:59.970
This cat would quickly...

